// ====================================================================================
// MODULE: Advanced Data Aggregation & Group Filtering (GROUP BY / HAVING)
// FILE: GetHighVolumeLeadSources.soql
//
// PROBLEM STATEMENT & BUSINESS VALUE:
// The Marketing and Demand Generation teams are auditing pipeline velocity to optimize 
// quarterly budget allocation. Looking at individual opportunity records causes data noise. 
// Instead, leadership requires a high-impact summary detailing which top-performing 
// customer acquisition channels (Lead Sources) successfully sustain scale. 
//
// To eliminate low-volume anomalies and focus strictly on high-yield strategic vectors, 
// this query isolates and returns only those Lead Sources that have actively converted 
// and sustained a high-volume pipeline threshold of more than 10 individual deal records.
// ====================================================================================

SELECT LeadSource, COUNT(Id)
FROM Opportunity 
GROUP BY LeadSource
HAVING COUNT(Id) > 10
